  "scenes": [
    {
      "sceneId": "S01",
      "narration": "欢迎来到项目管理核心模块的第一站——第 7 章《项目立项管理》。",
      "narrationSha256": "bface175bccb58d28497d76bfd3090c8389bdfbaf1807fe9defae1f268ef240e",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S01.wav",
      "wavSha256": "f60f72722b92050319e023153073dc2efb324712c2bcf275468fe2632c3b42d7",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 7664,
      "durationMs": 7664,
      "fromCache": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S02",
      "narration": "我们先看一下历年考情：2023 到 2026 年，去掉教材外的实践题，本章平均考 2 分左右，占比大概 2.68%，2026年2个批次分别考了2道题和1道题。虽然题量不大，但属于纯记忆送分题。",
      "narrationSha256": "d0956440eb583177c59d6ec01ed5a9e6397003afa7cc3f088c9c9d454b34106a",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S02.wav",
      "wavSha256": "43b1d67a71c15b2c28e87ad0f175d4abe464d86c71c6a6846f1228dd49988ad8",
      "startMs": 7664,
      "endMs": 26930,
      "durationMs": 19266,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S03",
      "narration": "本章的教学思路采用图谱速记的形式，课上老师不会带领大家念书，而是针对教材核心观点进行讲解。",
      "narrationSha256": "fd925d6c18e62f6e4d6b04fcf67d3c4df5ff1e259e51cbece6744e82575fbccd",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S03.wav",
      "wavSha256": "54358ef275d67599eb4ac089248a6992e2a3f1fc555638a02ea33db2d4ec701e",
      "startMs": 26930,
      "endMs": 36611,
      "durationMs": 9681,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S04",
      "narration": "很多同学会好奇：教材第 6 章是概论，第 8 章到第 19 章是十大知识领域、绩效域和配置变更，为什么我们先从第 7 章切入？",
      "narrationSha256": "fb9b313ba4ea2296d43957f8ea2c588eea0a0da95fe223c4e0100d4a66b7ab80",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S04.wav",
      "wavSha256": "aa7cedeea006893d930a32b62ab06af5526138ca462ee7d47a98f34176a7b16b",
      "startMs": 36611,
      "endMs": 50041,
      "durationMs": 13430,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S05",
      "narration": "看这条时间轴就明白了：在建项目之前，还有一个更源头的问题——项目建设是否有价值？组织为什么要掏几百万、几千万去建这个项目？本章正是要讲清楚立项所必需的论证文档与审批过程。",
      "narrationSha256": "38efc5f98c5adc1f5a1ece75ce9d3d2efb996cd05a065120270e1f2186144a9c",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S05.wav",
      "wavSha256": "eaab0b6be2dc8f663b0b1e84f1111ff3662a7d5d6ec209c1ac6db59a3b196745",
      "startMs": 50041,
      "endMs": 69515,
      "durationMs": 19474,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S06",
      "narration": "在建设之前，得从四个角度把账算清楚：第一，技术上适不适用、先不先进；第二，经济上合不合理、有没有效益；第三，实施上有没有可能、风险大不大；第四，社会价值上有没效果、能不能持续。",
      "narrationSha256": "604d4bd089fd8a14596bd6932c97a745fcd066f7a7d116935c0a03a094aa6244",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S06.wav",
      "wavSha256": "b921a5c19ba48420c0dbaada97f595f650f19e11757548243830b546d0aa3a7f",
      "startMs": 69515,
      "endMs": 92877,
      "durationMs": 23362,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S07",
      "narration": "围绕这四笔账，整个立项管理大体就分成三件事：提申请（项目建议与立项申请）、做论证（项目可行性研究）、拍板定案（项目评估与决策）。",
      "narrationSha256": "018c92db7305aea9dca023c6a53dacfe882d5b8e13de50a7de2bed1fffb1020c",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S07.wav",
      "wavSha256": "fd51441c6b3cccdddf171e1457dd6bc2d309cf7b889db20cdee771bc9ef8bd89",
      "startMs": 92877,
      "endMs": 110532,
      "durationMs": 17655,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S08",
      "narration": "如果把可行性研究拆细一点，在项目正式投资之前的立项论证，也就是教材所说的‘投资前时期’，一共要闯过四个阶段。分别是四个台阶：",
      "narrationSha256": "f9bbe6ba9501e3d43ea244690c097ad4afa6d4e73cd6343fc4396640f627eed0",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S08.wav",
      "wavSha256": "c9e06db6a8a6ae1d02a22f093fe965f8b2e8e1104361209e72004d76a15348ad",
      "startMs": 110532,
      "endMs": 124119,
      "durationMs": 13587,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S09",
      "narration": "第一步，项目建议与立项申请——先打报告说“我想干这件事”；第二步，初步可行性研究——先粗算一下这事有没有前途，值不值得花大力气深究；第三步，详细可行性研究——全面、深入地做技术方案比选和经济测算；第四步，评估与决策——请第三方来审一审可研报告靠不靠谱，最后拍板给不给钱、立不立项。",
      "narrationSha256": "3f8c1a7ecb7a3d2cddb40e6f29282299ecfcc54ab26c90f3e3f14f888efddbfb",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S09.wav",
      "wavSha256": "375daea36928637236f880dc38a266113110e34086ae0aaf168ea8a1cf6a2701",
      "startMs": 124119,
      "endMs": 163111,
      "durationMs": 38992,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S10",
      "narration": "这里有个考场高频防坑点：教材明确规定，投资前时期就是这四个阶段，没有“机会研究”或“机会可行性研究”！考题里如果拿“机会可行性研究”来凑数，直接排除。",
      "narrationSha256": "6acbb7a6ff808956b449f539b1b344b1ca225151669675df6d350c959472a7f7",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S10.wav",
      "wavSha256": "87be241269ba0ccca0307012500b779b8993023d0502195c0ec5f5e53d8bde51",
      "startMs": 163111,
      "endMs": 179369,
      "durationMs": 16258,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S11",
      "narration": "那实际工作里，是不是每个项目都得老老实实走完这四步呢？不一定，教材给了三条裁剪规则：",
      "narrationSha256": "6a32fdcdd1dfb22ac16d52181c8bae55849d2f1205ff9b3f7ad18d9346f40f7c",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S11.wav",
      "wavSha256": "55b80efdc4e231cb826424e22490ffeda41d285c58775f0c1a461b1a8e1ea471",
      "startMs": 179369,
      "endMs": 189817,
      "durationMs": 10448,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S12",
      "narration": "第一条最核心：初步可行性研究和详细可行性研究，可以根据项目的规模和繁简程度合二为一，但“详细可行性研究”是不可缺少的！记住，不管怎么省，详细可研绝对不能省。",
      "narrationSha256": "6b430e83ec2d13ba18475d8a47807eef1b6a75517892e0ffe74e29c330f5f492",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S12.wav",
      "wavSha256": "33b3f1faea769ca6226189ecb4178c72246d67a357c068e1590d3ac2f8c9f6f7",
      "startMs": 189817,
      "endMs": 207430,
      "durationMs": 17613,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S13",
      "narration": "第二条：如果是升级改造项目，因为原来就有底子，只做初步和详细可行性研究。第三条：如果是小项目，一般只进行详细可行性研究。",
      "narrationSha256": "2de17aba5fcf9bce6024d09a837fbc6a2246101f72c0df7672740b07ccdf570e",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S13.wav",
      "wavSha256": "c0cd1d50380b9891eccfe12002424040dced3cb9109f4bbae69cbe3c9c160b46",
      "startMs": 207430,
      "endMs": 223453,
      "durationMs": 16023,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S14",
      "narration": "我们马上看一道 2023 年 11 月的真题，检验一下刚才那四个阶段。题目问：项目投资前时期的四个阶段包括哪四个？给了五个编号：①项目建议与立项申请、②机会可行性研究、③初步可行性研究、④详细可行性研究、⑤评估与决策。",
      "narrationSha256": "ef036ced0a8c52a16b9b03a0b3d5bf292525a75fb82286a53ab4894da3710bf8",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S14.wav",
      "wavSha256": "b6857b53dde9256a5b7287e331eac87ccd60c688cdd3ba704aa43d3604bf5ac9",
      "startMs": 223453,
      "endMs": 248672,
      "durationMs": 25219,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S15",
      "narration": "给你两秒钟看一眼。",
      "narrationSha256": "d08489fef20d1be9b250d31ed1019090adb9cef1cb80dcd89685b3c621b224d0",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S15.wav",
      "wavSha256": "378b828ed07fd5c5ae274408f56b77a1f7c40bb192bb55e92fee39a8ad62c55e",
      "startMs": 248672,
      "endMs": 252835,
      "durationMs": 4163,
      "fromCache": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S16",
      "narration": "是不是一眼就能秒杀？刚才我们特别强调过，②“机会可行性研究”是命题人塞进来的干扰项，把它剔掉，留下的 ①③④⑤ 就是标准答案，直接选 C。",
      "narrationSha256": "60747cff05b4a435b49c551ac4a92c2da02fc6bc67ffd08e62d18192bafab022",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S16.wav",
      "wavSha256": "8ba78c3e6d504b2a1c6ee33080988e89ffa3f134f08ca53b061b4150493f34b5",
      "startMs": 252835,
      "endMs": 268003,
      "durationMs": 15168,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S17",
      "narration": "这里需要提示的是：即使实际项目中立项阶段是以项目建议书、可行性研究报告和初步设计为核心交付成果，但 ①③④⑤ 是教材的观点，做题的时候要以教材为准。",
      "narrationSha256": "082a1515eb23d7ae330d6c017c1c4a2fa0326c0ccba89853009e2a31e2e79a34",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S17.wav",
      "wavSha256": "7769024de831843e6251999309136a04a8369630aa5537b9d585effd4ffb33d2",
      "startMs": 268003,
      "endMs": 284290,
      "durationMs": 16287,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S18",
      "narration": "清楚了四步闯关的全局，我们现在走进第一步——7.1 项目建议与立项申请。首先记住它的名字：立项申请，又叫做《项目建议书》。考试题干里不管写“立项申请”还是写“项目建议书”，指的都是同一份文件。",
      "narrationSha256": "8cce7633bbf1540693a3d8ff143bf1dce5bc6bb8b13b8fe8059517862bdbd73a",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S18.wav",
      "wavSha256": "6201e433981790d9f188e8654007eb21683220982987adb76957093313753b3c",
      "startMs": 284290,
      "endMs": 305374,
      "durationMs": 21084,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S19",
      "narration": "这份文件在考场上最常考三个身份信息：第一，谁写给谁？它是项目建设单位（也就是筹建单位、甲方）根据国家规划、产业政策、市场情况和组织战略，向上级主管部门提交的申请文件。注意，不是乙方承建单位写的，也不是所有项目都去报给“国家监管部门”，而是报给上级主管部门。",
      "narrationSha256": "403646dd57dd295200ea3abbfaf1f98e06cfe2d61075551fdeb73c45ba92f107",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S19.wav",
      "wavSha256": "b6b163ed0380d60016e1a62bb9db5fe6d2faa2b38f03fe1efcd6398a31a5c508",
      "startMs": 305374,
      "endMs": 333755,
      "durationMs": 28381,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S20",
      "narration": "第二，它写到什么深度？它是项目发展周期的初始阶段，只是对拟建项目提出的“框架性总体设想”。注意“框架性设想”这五个字！因为这时候项目八字还没一撇，它绝对不是具体的“实施计划和方案”。",
      "narrationSha256": "2f16a57174342923bc0b2f8faff1e97e521c60b7373dc9c27bdb630994112264",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S20.wav",
      "wavSha256": "dc1ce5d709f43e05859349182806f407cca7dfbf761cd8dbf9928aa2181c0e76",
      "startMs": 333755,
      "endMs": 353193,
      "durationMs": 19438,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S21",
      "narration": "第三，它有什么用？它有两个核心作用：对上，它是国家或上级主管部门选择项目的依据；对下，它是开展可行性研究的依据。另外顺带留个印象：如果是涉及利用外资的项目，必须在项目建议书获得批准之后，才能开展后续工作。",
      "narrationSha256": "98c4112f12e5ccaa91ebb116b0a17e73809165abfac5f767d088a4b7576afd9f",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S21.wav",
      "wavSha256": "7bc8ba5fd74bf62e9f6288dff395feb7b5ca5249acdd777997a51a0c6ac5c00b",
      "startMs": 353193,
      "endMs": 377063,
      "durationMs": 23870,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S22",
      "narration": "来，趁热打铁，看 2026 年 5 月刚考过的这道第 42 题，题目问：关于项目建议书与立项申请的相关描述，正确的是哪一项？",
      "narrationSha256": "9dabf185664e41e56794c248aa9df9cb977e270fb54eb2427a463c12358e8aef",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S22.wav",
      "wavSha256": "9d135430d7f0c9cd40d03bfb755880088b17ad57dcdc549bfe1e35ce9df92935",
      "startMs": 377063,
      "endMs": 390320,
      "durationMs": 13257,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S23",
      "narration": "给你两秒钟扫一下四个选项。",
      "narrationSha256": "f5de1f83d2256c902f2ba3b8042cedb3cc977a56de3b21f6951b50032e6efb1b",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S23.wav",
      "wavSha256": "07a6e645c8e242b86511f00b8df5bf7368563f71d1ac41267a439d5238eab47b",
      "startMs": 390320,
      "endMs": 395542,
      "durationMs": 5222,
      "fromCache": true
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S24",
      "narration": "我们逐个看：A 选项说，立项申请是提出的“实施计划和方案”——错了吧？刚讲过，初始阶段只是框架性总体设想，还没到实施计划方案。",
      "narrationSha256": "21a17e08d71835357f9a949ca982cb02ea6301235ba2b9115931c2a081eb7184",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S24.wav",
      "wavSha256": "d9a305e1fa8bf4cf5052c3e2f268e2b6bed5a1e0511af52b6a00089985c5e357",
      "startMs": 395542,
      "endMs": 410851,
      "durationMs": 15309,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S25",
      "narration": "B 选项说，项目建议书是国家或上级主管部门选择项目的依据，也是可行性研究的依据——完全准确！再看 C 选项，它把“向上级主管部门提交”偷换成了“向国家监管部门提交”；D 选项说不包括必要性和必需条件，直接把核心内容说反了。所以这道题稳稳选 B。",
      "narrationSha256": "84f39f9bbb9c07f97d1115ef70996a79749fb32919880665314a0f843a2cabc7",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S25.wav",
      "wavSha256": "d03ef942d3369e168dd763674f872038d731634336480bd22d2c23d509453ee4",
      "startMs": 410851,
      "endMs": 439564,
      "durationMs": 28713,
      "fromCache": false
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S26",
      "narration": "刚才那道题的 D 选项提到了项目建议书的内容。在 7.1.2 节里，只有短短一句话，却在 2023 到 2024 年被一模一样连考了三次！",
      "narrationSha256": "c13cd02a8ca0eca85918686daf4f87ce9d686e62c3c47dfe35128bf9cc70f34c",
      "wavPath": "/projects/gaoxiang/course-video-pipeline-Gemini/workspaces/ch07-L01-ds/audio/S26.wav",
